ange","basis":"regnal_year_crosses_ce_year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"元朔二年，主父言齊王內淫佚行僻，上拜主父為齊相。至齊，遍召昆弟賓客，散五百金予之，數之曰：「始吾貧時，昆弟不我衣食，賓客不我內門；今吾相齊，諸君迎我或千里。吾與諸君絕矣，毋復入偃之門！」乃使人以王與姊姦事動王，王以為終不得脫罪，恐效燕王論死，乃自殺。有司以聞。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p025","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/112.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記曆書》索隱·太初改歲首","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記三家註/卷026&oldid=2514838","quote":"然漢始以建亥爲年首，今改以建寅，故以七年爲元年。","scope":"received_calendar_rule","text_layer":"suoyin_commentary","revision_id":2514838,"image_verified":false},{"table_id":"shiji-022","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r080-c00","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》","image_verified":false,"quote_passage_ref":"data/historical-tables/shiji-022.json"},{"table_id":"shiji-022","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r080-c01","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》","image_verified":false,"quote_passage_ref":"data/historical-tables/shiji-022.json"},{"table_id":"shiji-022","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r079-c01","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》","image_verified":false,"quote_passage_ref":"data/historical-tables/shiji-022.json"}],"regnal_year_table":{"kind":"table_year_row","table_id":"shiji-022","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-022","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-022","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-022","source_revision":"2607038","era_name":"元朔","year_source_term":"二年","era_anchor_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r079-c01","regnal_year_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r080-c01","digital_year_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r080-c00",